      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚡ TikTok & Instagram Reels Breakout Audio & Hashtag Virality Early-Warning Bot\n\n**What this workflow does:**\nAlert your social media team on Slack when a commercial-safe TikTok or Reels audio track surges in 24-hour creator adoption.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [`laborious_rumor/tiktok-instagram-sound-hashtag-virality-tracker`](https://apify.com/laborious_rumor/tiktok-instagram-sound-hashtag-virality-tracker) (*First 1,000 results 100% Free — zero login cookies required!*)\n\n### Setup in 30 Seconds:\n1. Get your free Apify API token at [console.apify.com/settings/integrations](https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations).\n2. Open the **Run Apify TikTok & Reels Trending Audio & Hashtags** HTTP Request node and replace `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` with your token.\n3. Click **Test Workflow** to extract, deduplicate, and score live structured JSON records!",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 640
      },
      "id": "a7540650-7e2b-4528-a921-54a579e8e352",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🔎 Stage 1: Schedule, Target Queries & Apify Extraction\nTriggers daily, sets your target search queries and `maxItems`, and runs the cookie-free **TikTok & Reels Trending Audio & Hashtags** Actor synchronously via the Apify REST API.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 740
      },
      "id": "f5f0bc00-82a8-4c58-ac56-9a99abba680d",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 1 Extraction",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
